d a simple but effective troll that poked fun at its opponent's propensity to emphasize the \"the\" in \"The Ohio State University.\"","published":"2026-11-22T04:22:49.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50554531/nebraska-ohio-state-trolls-college-football-week-12","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN staff","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Georgia clinches SEC title game berth with win at South Carolina","description":"Nate Frazier ran for 94 yards and two touchdowns, and No. 1 Georgia clinched a spot in the final SEC championship game with a victory over South Carolina on Saturday night.","published":"2026-11-22T05:47:52.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50558713/georgia-clinches-sec-title-game-berth-win-south-carolina","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"What are the conference title game clinching scenarios for Week 12?","description":"Here's what teams from every conference would need to play for their league championship.","published":"2026-11-22T04:00:22.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50512475/conference-title-game-clinching-scenarios-week-12","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Miami tops Virginia Tech, to face Wake Forest in ACC title game","description":"Miami will play Wake Forest in the ACC title game on Dec. 5 after both teams won on Saturday.","published":"2026-11-22T04:46:52.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50558418/miami-tops-virginia-tech-face-wake-forest-acc-title-game","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Betting buzz: Big Ten's odds of national champion four-peat getting slim","description":"Losses by UCLA, Indiana and Ohio State make the Big Ten's chances of winning the national championship this season a long shot.","published":"2026-11-22T04:06:20.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/espn/betting/story/_/id/49921234/college-football-betting-buzz-odds-updates-line-moves-spreads","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Emotional Greg Schiano authors 'special' win, Rutgers' first at PSU since 1988","description":"Less than two weeks after Rutgers announced embattled Greg Schiano would return as coach for a 19th season, the Scarlet Knights stunned Penn State 25-24 on Saturday, their first win over the Nittany Lions since 1988, and just their third this year.","published":"2026-11-22T02:56:26.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50557643/rutgers-authors-special-win-1st-penn-state-1988","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"}],"links":{"espn":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5127738/ashton-hampton","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ashton_Hampton"},"pick":{"pick":8,"round":1,"team":"ATL","provisional":false},"wiki":{"rules":4,"title":"Ashton Hampton","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ashton_Hampton","description":"American football player (born 2006)","touched":"2026-11-22T04:18:24Z","intro":"Ashton Hampton (born January 9, 2006) is an American college football cornerback for the Clemson Tigers.","sections":[{"key":"early","title":"Early life","text":"Hampton attended Florida State University High School in Tallahassee, Florida, where he played cornerback and wide receiver. He was the All-Big Bend Defensive Player of the Year his senior year after recording 64 tackles and three interceptions. During his career he had 92 tackles and six interceptions on defense and 115 receptions for 1,797 yards and 21 touchdowns as a receiver. Hampton committed to Clemson University to play college football."},{"key":"college","title":"College career","text":"Hampton earned immediate playing time his freshman year at Clemson in 2024. He started four of 14 games and had 30 tackles and two interception, one that was returned for a touchdown. He started all 13 games his sophomore year in 2025, recording 45 tackles and one interception."}]}}